        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:12.8pt; width:541.31pt; line-height:11pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.19pt;">Maxim Group LLC is acting as the exclusive placement agent in this offering. In addition to the placement agent fee of 8% of the aggregate purchase price, we have agreed to pay a reimbursement for the reasonable and accounted fees and expenses of legal counsel up to US$50,000. After deducting fees and expenses payable to placement agents and other estimated offering expenses payable by us, we expect to receive proceeds of US$6.6 million from this offering.</font>
        </div>
        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:5pt; width:541.31pt; line-height:11pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.19pt;">We expect that the delivery of the ADSs and Warrants being offered pursuant to this prospectus supplement and the accompanying prospectus will be made on or before July 19, 2023.</font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:12pt; text-align:center; width:541.31pt; line-height:16pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:14pt;">
