                <div style="white-space:nowrap;">
                  <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Hypothetical pre-tax earnings</font><font style=" position:relative; bottom:4.25pt;font-size:7.5pt;letter-spacing:0.15pt;">(1)</font>
                </div>
              </td>
