        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:16pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">The table above assumes for illustrative purposes that 4,285,711,875 Class&#160;A ordinary shares represented by 11,428,565 ADSs are sold at a price of US$0.70 per ADS, for aggregate gross proceeds of approximately US$8.0&#160;million. </font>
