              <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Taxes and other governmental charges the depositary or the custodian has to pay on any ADSs or Class&#160;A ordinary shares represented by ADSs, such as stock transfer taxes, stamp duty or withholding taxes </font>
            </td>
