        <div style="width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">shares. The following summary also does not address all aspects of U.S. federal income taxation that may be important to particular investors in light of their individual circumstances or to persons in special tax situations such as: </font>
        </div>
        <div style=" float:left; margin-left:20pt; line-height:12pt; margin-top:6.29pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:10pt;white-space:nowrap;">
