          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">a discussion of any material or special Cayman Islands or United States federal income tax considerations applicable to the preferred shares; </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style=" float:left; margin-left:20pt; line-height:12pt; margin-top:5.3pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:10pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8226;</font>
